"This check reads your accounting data and does not change it. It does not "
"replace a review by your accountant, and it does not certify the compliance "
"of the software."
msgstr ""
"Ce contrôle lit vos données comptables sans les modifier. Il ne remplace pas"
" la revue de votre expert-comptable et ne certifie pas la conformité du "
"logiciel."

